{"package":"SurgicalAutodeskCleaner","version":"2.10.1","assessment":"complete","packageSha256":"e9ca3a74cd9957d0eb5d10b0d617da055cb8d6f0a6f7fb4bb18467c07ac0cfc3","scannedAt":"2026-10-24T11:35:09.811Z","scannerVersion":"0.1.0","rulesetVersion":"0.1.0","tools":{"powerShell":"7.5.12","psscriptAnalyzer":"1.25.0","psscriptAnalyzerExpected":"1.25.0"},"packageUrl":"https://www.powershellgallery.com/packages/SurgicalAutodeskCleaner/2.10.1","metadata":{"title":"SurgicalAutodeskCleaner","description":"A professional, enterprise-grade PowerShell module for surgical extraction and total system purging of Autodesk software.\r\n    \r\n    Compatible with PowerShell 5.1 and 7.0+. Note: Interactive Mode (TUI) is best experienced in PowerShell 7+.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Start-SACInteractive (Alias: Start-SAC): Full interactive main menu with a conditional \"View Last Run Logs\" viewer. Supports remote WinRM dispatch, pending reboot checking, and service hardening.\r\n- Start-SACCleanup: Surgical background removal tool with reboot deletion queue for locked files, targeted Autodesk-only temp folder clearing, and wide product support. Supports -WhatIf.\r\n- Start-SACPurge: Scorched-earth registry and file system master purge with explicit AGS/Genuine service removal, general temp clearing, and Desktop Connector caches wipe. Supports -WhatIf.\r\n- Start-SACScan: Generates CSV pre-flight scan reports of targeted deletions.\r\n- Reset-SACUserProfile: Resets per-user Autodesk AppData (rename Roaming, delete Local) and removes root user caches (ACCDocs, BIM 360) for a clean-start experience.\r\n- Reset-SACLicensing: Wipes CLM, AdskLicensing, and SSO token cache to force clean re-authentication.\r\n- Restore-SACUserProfile: Lists, restores, or purges Roaming profile backups created by Reset-SACUserProfile.\r\n- Invoke-SACRemote: Dispatches SAC tasks to remote endpoints via WinRM.\r\n- Repair-SACODIS: Uninstalls, cleans/renames directory states, downloads the latest version, and silently reinstalls Autodesk On-Demand Install Service (ODIS) to fix installer failures.\r\n\r\nSafety: Add/Remove Programs entries are evicted only after the product's Windows Installer registration is confirmed gone, an uninstaller returning 3010 halts the run until the machine is rebooted, and every run verifies the installer hives directly for orphaned product and patch registrations. Start-SACCleanup, Start-SACPurge and Repair-SACODIS all support -WhatIf.\r\n\r\nExample RMM usage: Start-SACCleanup -TargetProducts \"AutoCAD\", \"Revit\" -T","authors":"Dailen","owners":"dailen","projectUrl":"https://github.com/DailenG/SurgicalAutodeskCleaner","publishedAt":"2026-09-09T14:40:01.657","updatedAt":"2026-10-23T20:40:01.3","tags":["Autodesk","Cleanup","Purge","Uninstall","Licensing","UserProfile","Dailen","PSModule","PSFunction_Start-SACCleanup","PSCommand_Start-SACCleanup","PSFunction_Start-SACPurge","PSCommand_Start-SACPurge","PSFunction_Start-SACInteractive","PSCommand_Start-SACInteractive","PSFunction_Start-SACScan","PSCommand_Start-SACScan","PSFunction_Reset-SACUserProfile","PSCommand_Reset-SACUserProfile","PSFunction_Reset-SACLicensing","PSCommand_Reset-SACLicensing","PSFunction_Restore-SACUserProfile","PSCommand_Restore-SACUserProfile","PSFunction_Invoke-SACRemote","PSCommand_Invoke-SACRemote","PSFunction_Repair-SACODIS","PSCommand_Repair-SACODIS","PSIncludes_Function"]},"dependencies":[],"fileInventory":[{"path":"_rels/.rels","size":517,"crc32":"4a4dbe48","extension":"rels"},{"path":"SurgicalAutodeskCleaner.nuspec","size":2938,"crc32":"8b3f6bc0","extension":"nuspec"},{"path":".gitignore","size":35,"crc32":"5717b491","extension":"gitignore"},{"path":"AGENTS.md","size":1050,"crc32":"71e272c2","extension":"md"},{"path":".git/config","size":461,"crc32":"aafce9ea","extension":"git/config"},{"path":".git/hooks/pre-applypatch.sample","size":424,"crc32":"024cc0cf","extension":"sample"},{"path":".git/logs/HEAD","size":5975,"crc32":"d42f93b8","extension":"git/logs/head"},{"path":".